---
// The documented boundary of a module-graph check, made executable rather than left as
// a caveat in prose.
//
// This page loads an auth SDK the way Clerk's own browser bundle is meant to be
// loaded — a plain <script> tag pointing at a CDN — and it produces ZERO edges in the
// build graph. Invariant A and Invariant B are both blind to it, and both are RIGHT to
// be: there is no import here for a bundler to resolve. Anything hand-placed under
// public/ has the same shape.
//
// The complementary assertion that does catch it scans the HTML the build emitted.
// This page is what proves that scan is not vacuous either.
---

<script is:inline src="https://cdn.clerk.io/clerk.browser.js"></script>
<p>cdn script</p>
